  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n∠BAC = 60°\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c6ed43c35fb557ee8e71017b8f6239249d38f9be08dfd43dd512f351965fe443.png] \n\n∠OBC = 2∠OBA\n\n∠OCB = 2∠OCA\n\nIn ΔABC,\n\n∠ABC + ∠ACB + ∠BAC = 180°\n\n∠ABC + ∠ACB = 120°\n\n∠OBA + ∠OBC + ∠OCA + ∠OCB = 120°\n\n∠OBC/2 + ∠OBC + ∠OCB/2 + ∠OCB = 120°\n\n∠OBC + ∠OCB = 80°\n\nIn ΔOBC,\n\n∠OBC + ∠OCB + ∠BOC = 180°\n\n**∴∠BOC = 180° - 80° = 100° **",
